 i veri Signori di Salem stanno tornando, e vogliono sangue..","tagline":"Siamo in attesa... Siamo sempre in attesa"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Heidi, a radio DJ, is sent a box containing a record - a \"gift from the Lords\". The sounds within the grooves trigger flashbacks of her town's violent past. Is Heidi going mad, or are the Lords back to take revenge on Salem, Massachusetts?","tagline":"We've been waiting...we've always been waiting."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hkjySGIWeFRt2TpdNgdUMcYA24.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qdrmWfJPewIeZE9gU9ihr9diPbm.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":104755,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hkjySGIWeFRt2TpdNgdUMcYA24.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7hkjySGIWeFRt2TpdNgdUMcYA24.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hkjySGIWeFRt2TpdNgdUMcYA24.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7hkjySGIWeFRt2TpdNgdUMcYA24.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4uAKv6ihcYn0eB2arLaWg3BAupy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4uAKv6ihcYn0eB2arLaWg3BAupy.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dAnSbc1o3hIqCsBYpiEBGC3FgPJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dAnSbc1o3hIqCsBYpiEBGC3FgPJ.jpg","language":"it","width":1110,"height":1506}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nqZ6CGGZpQWt139YioekSYHvvkU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nqZ6CGGZpQWt139YioekSYHvvkU.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},